## Dependency Management

<!-- cs: Správa závislostí -->

Set tool versions to match `requires-python` in `[project]` — that is the single source of truth.
<!-- cs: Nastav verze nástrojů podle requires-python v [project] — to je jediný zdroj pravdy. -->

```toml
# pyproject.toml
[project]
requires-python = ">=3.11"   # <-- single source of truth for Python version

[tool.ruff]
line-length = 100
target-version = "py311"     # must match requires-python
[tool.ruff.lint]
select = ["E", "F", "I", "UP", "B", "SIM"]

[tool.mypy]
python_version = "3.11"      # must match requires-python
strict = true

[tool.pytest.ini_options]
markers = [
    "unit: fast, no I/O",
    "integration: requires DB or network",
    "slow: > 5s",
]
```

- Justify every new dependency with a comment in `requirements.txt` or `pyproject.toml`.
  <!-- cs: Každou novou závislost zdůvodni komentářem. -->
- Never `pip install` without adding to the dependency file.
  <!-- cs: Nikdy pip install bez přidání do souboru závislostí. -->
